message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: RakTikoo
title: "patchproof: find the 9-slice borders of game UI panels, and prove each one"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/patchproof"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RakTikoo/patchproof"
abstract: >-
  Finds the 9-slice (nine-patch) borders of every panel in a game UI kit and
  proves each border by reconstructing the panel at other sizes, reporting
  any panel it cannot prove as uncertain.
keywords:
  - 9-slice
  - nine-patch
  - UI
  - game art
  - sprites
